<title>PHILIPPINES: Mondragon jumps 10 pct to 13.75 pesos.</title>
<headline>Mondragon jumps 10 pct to 13.75 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in leisure and retail company Mondragon International Philippines gained 1.25 pesos to 13.75 pesos by midsession in Manila on Wednesday on market talk that its casino operations may be picking up, brokers said.</p>
</text>
